# docs/ IS tracked on purpose: the commercial and legal documents
# (00_LEGAL, 01_LICENSE_REMEDIATION, offer, pricing) exist nowhere else,
# and an untracked docs/ means one lost disk = they are gone. 2.7 MB of
# markdown costs nothing to version. Do not re-add a `docs` rule here.
doc.md

